// Use the shared block +contract without defining it in the diagram
architecture Call a token contract

box user as User [note: holds tokens, icon: user]
+contract token as Token contract [note: keeps the balances]
box shop as Shop [note: receives tokens, icon: cart]

step Call
  say The user calls transfer on the token contract.
  user -> token: transfer

step Move
  say The contract moves the tokens from the user's balance to the shop's balance.
  token -> shop: tokens [carry: coin]
